; `open` listed in a flat `:symbols` import — route 2 of 4 of
; `reserved_open_direct.ein`'s declaration.
;
; `:symbols (open)` writes the reserved name in this file, so the grammar
; refuses it here, at the listing. The other routes are refused at the
; module's own line: the same declaration, refused whichever way it comes.
(import reserved_open_direct :symbols (open))
